[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2678925926","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99614#issuecomment-2678925926","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99614","id":2678925926,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6frSpm","user":{"login":"L4Vo5","id":37083802,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MDgzODAy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37083802?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/L4Vo5","html_url":"https://github.com/L4Vo5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L4Vo5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L4Vo5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L4Vo5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L4Vo5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L4Vo5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L4Vo5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L4Vo5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L4Vo5/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L4Vo5/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-24T16:01:12Z","updated_at":"2025-02-24T16:01:43Z","body":"Me and someone else ran into this back in July, and the solution we came up with was very similar to this, but we never did make a PR.\r\n\r\n```c++\r\n} else if (p_node->get_parent()->get_owner() != p_owner) {\r\n\t// Node's parent is owned by an edited scene\r\n\tnd.index = p_node->get_index();\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nIn this part, do you skip checking `is_editable_instance` on `get_parent()->get_owner()` because the only way to have a parent whose owner isn't the scene owner is if it's part of an editable scene? Maybe it'd be prudent to do the check anyways, in case that assumption ever changes?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2678925926/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2684011400","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99614#issuecomment-2684011400","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99614","id":2684011400,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6f-sOI","user":{"login":"Haydoggo","id":14885846,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODg1ODQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14885846?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haydoggo","html_url":"https://github.com/Haydoggo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haydoggo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haydoggo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haydoggo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haydoggo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haydoggo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haydoggo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haydoggo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haydoggo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haydoggo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-26T06:14:07Z","updated_at":"2025-02-26T06:14:07Z","body":"> In this part, do you skip checking is_editable_instance on get_parent()->get_owner() because the only way to have a parent whose owner isn't the scene owner is if it's part of an editable scene? Maybe it'd be prudent to do the check anyways, in case that assumption ever changes?\r\n\r\nYou make a good point, it's probably better to explicitly check if the parent's owner is an editable scene. I'll make that change when I get a chance (no rush seeing as this has been pushed back to 4.5 now anyway).\r\n\r\nI've just marked this PR as a draft for now to avoid invoking the CI pipeline needlessly, but hopefully I'll be able to get this in soon and get it on the team's radar (and maybe even marked for cherry picking 🤞)\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2684011400/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3764703316","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99614#issuecomment-3764703316","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99614","id":3764703316,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7gZNBU","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-18T02:15:08Z","updated_at":"2026-01-18T02:15:25Z","body":"This is tricky to review because destroying scenes is no fun. \r\n\r\nAlso is a godot packed scene version increment probably.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3764703316/reactio